<section class="rt-lifestyle-section" id="Unisex">
  <div class="rt-section-header">
    <span class="rt-section-badge">UNISEX BY DESIGN</span>
    <h2 class="rt-section-title">One Watch. Infinite Fits.</h2>
    <p class="rt-section-sub">
      The Casio vintage steel isn't bound by gender or occasion. Its clean 36mm face geometry compliments any wrist profile.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="rt-lifestyle-grid">
    <div class="rt-lifestyle-card">
      <div>
        <span class="rt-lifestyle-tag">ARCHITECTURE & STREETWEAR</span>
        <h3 class="rt-lifestyle-title">Bold, Architectural, Industrial</h3>
        <p class="rt-lifestyle-desc">
          Pair with tailored linen, oversized hoodies, dark denim, or monochrome streetwear. The silver steel case catches the light with subtle sophistication without screaming for attention.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rt-lifestyle-quote">
        "The only watch that looks just as natural in a design studio as it does at an underground concert."
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-lifestyle-card">
      <div>
        <span class="rt-lifestyle-tag">PARISIAN & RETRO MINIMALISM</span>
        <h3 class="rt-lifestyle-title">Effortless, Elegant, Retro Chic</h3>
        <p class="rt-lifestyle-desc">
          Stack with delicate silver bangles or wear solo with a crisp white shirt or slip dress. Its slim 9.6mm profile ensures a featherlight, comfortable fit from daybreak to evening dinner.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rt-lifestyle-quote">
        "It’s not just a timepiece—it’s an instant vintage style statement that outlives every passing trend."
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

